  speakerNpcId: prof_toby
  playerFacingPolicy: 0
  lines:
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: 'Behold: the Orbs. Or as I call ''em, digital slop containers'
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: "Inside\u2019s a chainling. Basically a portable attack mutt that\u2019ll
      keep you safe"
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: Chainlings have survived more cycles than you've had hot dinners. It toughened
      them up
    typeSpeed: 55
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: "or maybe just broke \u2019em the right way. Either way, they\u2019ll scrap
      so you don\u2019t have to"
    typeSpeed: 55
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: Go on, {playerName}. Don't take your time! The chain waits for no one
    typeSpeed: 55
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
